{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22298","headline":"移家入新宅 · 白居易","name":"移家入新宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"移家入新宅，罢郡有余赀。\n既可避燥湿，复免忧寒饥。\n疾平未还假，官闲得分司。\n幸有俸禄在，而无职役羁。\n清旦盥漱毕，开轩卷帘帏。\n家人及鸡犬，随我亦熙熙。\n取兴或寄酒，放情不过诗。\n何必苦修道，此即是无爲。\n外累信已遣，中怀时有思。\n有思一何远，默坐低双眉。\n十载囚窜客，万里征戍儿。\n春朝鏁笼鸟，冬夜支牀龟。\n驿马走四蹄，痛酸无歇期。\n磑牛封两目，昏闭何人知。\n谁能脱放去，四散任所之。\n各得适其性，如吾今日时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22298.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22298","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}